{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/f830a59e61bbc5feabb1b114f9af2781.webp?t=1764304128\" alt=\"It&#039;s not about size or speed, it&#039;s about technique.\" width=760 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Berith, a demon priestess ready to shoot her way through an angel-infested Hell, in her crusade to hunt three powerful demons that have been corrupted by the angelic forces. Unleash your arsenal of four powerful guns and weave between them in order to string together stylish combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/71fb3f03b70f63aea2466b497a226196.poster.avif?t=1764304128\" aria-label=\"A really short demonstration of combos, guns, and enemies.\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/71fb3f03b70f63aea2466b497a226196.webm?t=1764304128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/71fb3f03b70f63aea2466b497a226196.mp4?t=1764304128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/dddc7751705d933dfe1f76fdc5b867b8.avif?t=1764304128\" alt=\"The combos.\" width=370 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use all the weapons given to you!</strong><br>Earn COMBO RANKS by shooting with different weapons. Switching weapons allows you to shoot faster. Heal yourself by damaging enemies at a high COMBO RANK.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augment your mobility with three different dashes</strong>!<br>By DASHING at the maximum COMBO RANK, you can slow down time, become invisible or create a powerful explosion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augment your power with three different rings!\u00a0</strong><br>While aiming with your other hand, the rings give you extra powers, as a stun zone, a protective wall or teleport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never stop shooting</strong>  <br>Instantly reload all weapons by shooting with all guns at least once. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/12317a573be88ee2381da212c3e4f55a.avif?t=1764304128\" alt=\"The guns.\" width=370 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every gun comes equipped with a main fire mode and an unlockable alternate fire mode.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Belial</strong> and the <strong>Purson</strong> are a pair of shotguns that complement each other's damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Ballista</strong> fires an explosive, flaming bolt, setting enemies on fire and increasing the damage they take. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Asmodeus Opus</strong> is a revolver that deals serious damage against dying enemies. Upon killing them, it redirects your bullet and reloads all weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/6f3c3e01506e8261fa41d8f818636e4b.poster.avif?t=1764304128\" aria-label=\"Guns showcase\" width=800 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/6f3c3e01506e8261fa41d8f818636e4b.webm?t=1764304128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/6f3c3e01506e8261fa41d8f818636e4b.mp4?t=1764304128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/24809e603cc9eb16618216b6854a9da7.webp?t=1764304128\" alt=\"Will Berith attain peace?\" width=760 height=61 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2599580?t=1764304128","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/ea7fa0f00094dfbd06a64a507af59ad0eebe8c0d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764304128","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/03dfdeaed9d2ef6f9666e8ac8f6cbd4896a716f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764304128","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/03dfdeaed9d2ef6f9666e8ac8f6cbd4896a716f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764304128","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3045550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/