e or create a powerful explosion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augment your power with three different rings!\u00a0</strong><br>While aiming with your other hand, the rings give you extra powers, as a stun zone, a protective wall or teleport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never stop shooting</strong>  <br>Instantly reload all weapons by shooting with all guns at least once. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/12317a573be88ee2381da212c3e4f55a.avif?t=1764304128\" alt=\"The guns.\" width=370 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every gun comes equipped with a main fire mode and an unlockable alternate fire mode.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Belial</strong> and the <strong>Purson</strong> are a pair of shotguns that complement each other's damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Ballista</strong> fires an explosive, flaming bolt, setting enemies on fire and increasing the damage they take. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Asmodeus Opus</strong> is a revolver that deals serious damage against dying enemies. Upon killing them, it redirects your bullet and reloads all weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/6f3c3e01506e8261fa41d8f818636e4b.poster.avif?t=1764304128\" aria-label=\"Guns showcase\" width=800 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/6f3c3e01506e8261fa41d8f818636e4b.webm?t=1764304128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/extras/6f3c3e01506e8261fa41d8f8