c.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599580/ss_1facc904a4859af7506687473d44798286a0697c.600x338.jpg?t=1764304128"}],"short_description":"Heavenstrafer is a fast paced movement shooter with a gun combo system that rewards aggressiveness and experimentation. Explore the ruins of hell and destroy angels (and demons) across three chapters filled with compact but challenging arenas.","steam_appid":2599580,"support_info":{"email":"suporteoculto.steam@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Portuguese - Brazil","type":"game","website":null}